clueweb09-en0002-84-23342.130 article puts the focus on how you can give quit smoking support to friends and family members when they need it most. Encouraging Others to Quit Smoking How you approach the subject of quitting with a smoker is important. Do the research ahead of time to learn what nicotine addiction is about. Try to be understanding! This article describes what your friend or loved one is going through, and gives good advice on how you can help. Free Smoking Cessation Newsletter!Sign Up Discuss in my Forum Explore Smoking Cessation Must Reads Nicotine Withdrawal After The Last Cigarette Your Quit Smoking Toolbox Shocking Tobacco Facts 10 Things to Avoid When You Quit Smoking Most Popular Benefits of Quitting SmokingCigarette IngredientsEffects of Cigarette SmokingNicotine WithdrawalQuit Smoking Benefits - 2 Days Free Smoking Cessation Newsletter!Sign Up By Category Reasons to Quit Smoking Quit Smoking Help Quit Smoking Aids After You Quit Smoking Motivational
